                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Turcopolis: Turcopoles (dative case): a Turkic group allied with Byzantium. Turcopolis comes from the Greek 'Sons of Turks' τουρκόπουλοι = Τοῦρκος + πουλος"/>
                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="urbem: city; singular feminine accusative from urbs, urbis"/>
