                <ITEXT CH="Turcī: the Turks"/>
                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Turcopōlīs: Turcopoles (ablative case): a Turkic group allied with Byzantium. Turcopolis comes from the Greek 'Sons of Turks' τουρκόπουλοι = Τοῦρκος + πουλος"/>
                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Turcopūlōs: Turcopoles (accusative case): a Turkic group allied with Byzantium. Turcopolis comes from the Greek 'Sons of Turks' τουρκόπουλοι = Τοῦρκος + πουλος"/>
                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
