                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Solimānus: Kilij Arslan a.k.a. Suleiman II, Seljuk sultan of Rûm and leader of the Turkish forces in Anatolia during the first crusade; son of Suleiman I"/>
