                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="dēmōnstrārēmus: we might have been proving, demonstrating, showing; 1st person plural imperfect active subjunctive from dēmōnstrō, dēmōnstrāre, dēmōnstrāvī, dēmōnstrātus"/>
                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="dīligenter: diligently"/>
