                <para PARENT="Vocab"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Grentamasnil: Grandmesnil. Hugo de Grandmesnil was a companion of William the Conqueror at the Battle of Hastings. Two of his sons, William and Aubrey, are discussed in the passage fleeing from Antioch."/>
